{"id":"1","category":"retrograde","planet":"Venus","zodiac_sign":"Libra","house":null,"aspect":null,"traditional_effect":"Reevaluation of relationships and values","underlying_theme":"Non-dual love and self-worth","positive_interpretation":"As Venus moves backward, you are invited to see love not as something external to acquire, but as the fabric of your own being. This period gently reveals how relationships mirror internal states, offering a chance to reconcile fragmented parts of yourself. By embracing stillness, you may find that connection exists everywhere, dissolving the illusion of separation between lover and beloved within your heart.","growth_opportunity":"Recognizing self-love as the source of all connection","practical_action":"Sit quietly and visualize love radiating from your heart to others","reflection_question":"Where do I seek outside validation instead of acknowledging inner worth?","encouraging_message":"Remember, you are the love you seek, always deeply present within.","disclaimer":"This is a symbolic astrological interpretation, not a guaranteed outcome."}
